doc:sec-9-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "9(2) Modification of Administrative Appeals Tribunal Act" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) If the Honourable Donald Gerard Stewart is appointed to hold office as a full-time Deputy President of the Administrative Appeals Tribunal by an appointment that takes effect at a time when he holds the office of Chairman of the National Crime Authority then, while he holds the second-mentioned office, he is not entitled to receive any remuneration in respect of his holding the first-mentioned office except to the extent (if any) to which the remuneration that, but for this subsection, would be payable to him in respect of his holding the first-mentioned office exceeds the remuneration payable to him in respect of his holding the second-mentioned office." ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer .

concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-9-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "9(3) Modification of Administrative Appeals Tribunal Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-9-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the Honourable Donald Gerard Stewart holds office as a full-time Deputy President of the Administrative Appeals Tribunal while he holds the office of Chairperson of the Resources Assessment Commission, then, while he holds both offices, he is not entitled to receive any remuneration in respect of his office of Deputy President except to the extent (if any) to which the remuneration that, but for this subsection, would be payable to him in respect of his office of Deputy President exceeds the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00791    Section 9" ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the Honourable Donald Gerard Stewart holds office as a full-time Deputy President of the Administrative Appeals Tribunal while he holds the office of Chairperson of the Resources Assessment Commission, then, while he holds both offices, he is not entitled to receive any remuneration in respect of his office of Deputy President except to the extent (if any) to which the remuneration that, but for this subsection, would be payable to him in respect of his office of Deputy President exceeds the ComLaw Authoritative Act C2011C00791    Section 9"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "a542705fc73786d0f554486f5fa04de92f1b57faa468e6a74b05a7d1afe92b14" ;
    values:partOf concept:national-crime-authority-status-and-rights-of-former-chairman-act-1984-sec-9 ;
    cof:pageNumber "9"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "No remuneration for Deputy President office if Chairperson of Resources Assessment Commission" ;
